sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Maker (accountant)
    participant A as Accounting
    actor C as Checker (approver)
    participant W as Webhooks / listeners

    M->>A: Create draft entry (5,000,000)
    A-->>M: Saved as draft
    M->>A: Submit for approval
    A->>A: Check every posting rule now<br/>(balance, accounts, open period)
    A-->>M: Pending approval
    A-)W: journal_entry.submitted

    alt Approve
        C->>A: Approve & post
        A->>A: Checker ≠ maker / submitter?
        A->>A: Post (immutable, base amounts frozen)
        A-->>C: Posted
        A-)W: journal_entry.approved + journal_entry.posted
    else Reject
        C->>A: Reject with reason
        A-->>C: Rejected
        A-)W: journal_entry.rejected
        M->>A: Edit (back to draft) and resubmit
    end

    Note over M,C: Below the threshold the maker posts directly.<br/>Who did what and when is shown as the entry's audit trail.
